'</ul>',
'</div>'))
,p_list_template_current=>'<li class="amc-TSpotlightGrid-item is-current"><a class="amc-TSpotlightGrid-link" href="#LINK#" aria-current="page"><span class="amc-TSpotlightGrid-icon fa #ICON_CSS_CLASSES#" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="amc-TSpotlightGrid-body"><span class="amc-TSpotlightGrid-label">#TEXT#</span><span class="amc-TSpotlightGrid-desc">#A01#</span></span><span class="amc-TSpotlightGrid-tag">#A02#</span></a></li>'
,p_list_template_noncurrent=>'<li class="amc-TSpotlightGrid-item"><a class="amc-TSpotlightGrid-link" href="#LINK#"><span class="amc-TSpotlightGrid-icon fa #ICON_CSS_CLASSES#" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="amc-TSpotlightGrid-body"><span class="amc-TSpotlightGrid-label">#TEXT#</span><span class="amc-TSpotlightGrid-desc">#A01#</span></span><span class="amc-TSpotlightGrid-tag">#A02#</span></a></li>'
,p_list_template_name=>'AMC Spotlight Grid'
,p_internal_name=>'AMC_TPL_SPOTLIGHT_GRID'
,p_javascript_file_urls=>'#APP_FILES#amc-templates/amc-tpl-spotlight-grid.js'
,p_theme_id=>42
,p_css_file_urls=>'#APP_FILES#amc-templates/amc-tpl-spotlight-grid.css'
,p_a01_label=>'Description'
,p_a02_label=>'Tag'
,p_list_template_comment=>'List template for a List region. Each entry is a tile with its icon, text, a description from User Defined Attribute 1 and an optional tag from Attribute 2, for example ''New'' or ''3 due''. The optional JavaScript file moves the spotlight with the pointer across the whole grid; without it, or on touch screens and under reduced motion, tiles light up statically on hover. Keyboard focus lights the focused tile and shows a focus ring. The current entry keeps a soft glow at rest. Template options: Intense light, Compact tiles, Rows, Night tiles.'
);
end;
